                <pb facs="0577" n="503" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg503"/>

                <head>No. 1.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<placeName>Ferroll</placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-15">February 15</date>, 9h.
                        12m. a. m.–Translation.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">The Consular Agent of the United States to the Chargé
                        d’Affaires.</hi></p>
                <p>The Niagara in this port. The Stonewall to-day, they say, will be ready. I
                    received telegram—am informed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FERNANDEZ.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
